    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951890/extras/5e24cb7a647d39cc55ef074838ba852b.avif?t=1715080916\" width=640 height=120 /></span><br><br><u>The main genre is &quot;Horror&quot;, &quot;Walking Simulator&quot;.</u><br><br><strong>Description: </strong><br>A short horror game about a mysterious videotape that someone slipped under your door. Do you dare to watch it?!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951890/extras/a88a1b57e46fc277430c45b5881563db.poster.avif?t=1715080916\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951890/extras/a88a1b57e46fc277430c45b5881563db.webm?t=1715080916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951890/extras/a88a1b57e46fc277430c45b5881563db.mp4?t=1715080916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Peculiarities:</strong><br><u>VHS Effect.</u><br><u>Realistic graphics.</u><br><u>Frighteningly natural sound design.</u><br><br><i>Approximate game duration: 30 - 40 minutes.</i><br><br><br><u><i>Note:<br>The game does not have a menu or any settings to make the game the way the author intended.<br>To exit the game, press Alt+F4 or exit through the door in the main room.</i></u>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951890/extras/5e24cb7a647d39cc55ef074838ba852b.avif?t=1715080916\" width=640 height=120 /></span><br><br><u>The main genre is &quot;Horror&quot;, &quot;Walking Simulator&quot;.</u><br><br><strong>Description: </strong><br>A short horror game about a mysterious videotape that someone slipped under your door. Do you dare to watch it?!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951890/extras/a88a1b57e46fc277430c45b5881563db.poster.avif?t=1715080916\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951890/extras/a88a1b57e46fc277430c45b5881563db.webm?t=1715080916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951890/extras/a88a1b57e46fc277430c45b5881563db.mp4?t=1715080916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Peculiarities:</strong><br><u>VHS Effect.</u><br><u>Realistic graphics.</u><br><u>Frighteningly natural sound design.</u><br><br><i>Approximate game duration: 30 - 40 minutes.</i><br><br><br><u><i>Note:<br>The game does not have a menu or any settings to make the game the way the author intended.<br>To exit the game, press Alt+F4 or exit through the door in the main room.</i></u>",
